      "detailed_description": "<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/6c756c882ab94a9d4393a3aeafb33c25.avif?t=1772059192\" width=1560 height=718 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mall Simulator is a chill first-person simulation where you will experience a giant mall tycoon with various stores that you run yourself:</strong>  <br><br><strong>👕 Clothing ⚽ Sports 💻 Tech 🧸 Toys 🛒 Supermarket 💄 Cosmetics  <br>🎬 Cinema 🍔 Burger Shop 🕹️ Arcade 🏠 Home Goods 🎮 Game Store  <br>🥐 Bakery 💍 Jewelry 🌸 Florist 🍣 Sushi Bar 🥤 Vending Machines 💵 ATMs</strong><br><br><strong>…and so much more to explore in your mega mall!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ba77c14eb894118b5f2190b70f3dc7.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Design matters! Create the best design for your mall and manage your stores. Showcase your best-seller stores and create the perfect mall for your customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/c84ee29304b617e78002eae935b2c663.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Zero to hero! Open new stores of the most famous brands and sell their products in your mall. Expand your stores in the mall from a grocery to a jewellery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ddfd6444237d33b76b3d415003d410.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ddfd6444237d33b76b3d415003d410.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ddfd6444237d33b76b3d415003d410.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf40307ad0470cd44fbdd0ded1d71dc3.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Out of stock? Always supply new products and follow new trends to keep your customers in your mall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/4c48eed1f6dfcb1bee595b64abbd9c0b.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/4c48eed1f6dfcb1bee595b64abbd9c0b.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/4c48eed1f6dfcb1bee595b64abbd9c0b.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/901305078b85f939c03151299710952e.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Time is money! Your mall may be busy, take payments and hire new workers so you don't keep your customers waiting. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/50443e9f5c79e6ca22e7a85350f1c979.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/50443e9f5c79e6ca22e7a85350f1c979.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/50443e9f5c79e6ca22e7a85350f1c979.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/db5b77a23c56af0517d4dbe287465d82.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Smash the walls! Open up new spaces and make room for more stores and brands in your mall. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf17e6d5350077822e76a5fe2be47b82.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=744 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf17e6d5350077822e76a5fe2be47b82.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf17e6d5350077822e76a5fe2be47b82.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Mall Simulator, customer satisfaction is neccesary. You have to keep up with trends, build new stores, set smart prices and grow your mall to avoid going bankrupt.</strong></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mall Simulator is a chill first-person simulation where you will experience a giant mall tycoon with various stores that you run yourself:</strong>  <br><br><strong>👕 Clothing ⚽ Sports 💻 Tech 🧸 Toys 🛒 Supermarket 💄 Cosmetics  <br>🎬 Cinema 🍔 Burger Shop 🕹️ Arcade 🏠 Home Goods 🎮 Game Store  <br>🥐 Bakery 💍 Jewelry 🌸 Florist 🍣 Sushi Bar 🥤 Vending Machines 💵 ATMs</strong><br><br><strong>…and so much more to explore in your mega mall!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ba77c14eb894118b5f2190b70f3dc7.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Design matters! Create the best design for your mall and manage your stores. Showcase your best-seller stores and create the perfect mall for your customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/c84ee29304b617e78002eae935b2c663.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Zero to hero! Open new stores of the most famous brands and sell their products in your mall. Expand your stores in the mall from a grocery to a jewellery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"