ne poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/50443e9f5c79e6ca22e7a85350f1c979.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/50443e9f5c79e6ca22e7a85350f1c979.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/50443e9f5c79e6ca22e7a85350f1c979.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/db5b77a23c56af0517d4dbe287465d82.avif?t=1772059192\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Smash the walls! Open up new spaces and make room for more stores and brands in your mall. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf17e6d5350077822e76a5fe2be47b82.poster.avif?t=1772059192\" width=744 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf17e6d5350077822e76a5fe2be47b82.webm?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/bf17e6d5350077822e76a5fe2be47b82.mp4?t=1772059192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Mall Simulator, customer satisfaction is neccesary. You have to keep up with trends, build new stores, set smart prices and grow your mall to avoid going bankrupt.</strong></p>",
